      "Every office in India has one — a guard at the gate with a visitor register and sharp eyes. You hired him without a second thought, because leaving your office unguarded felt irresponsible. So here's the question nobody asks out loud: why do most Indian businesses guard their office gate more seriously than their IT infrastructure?",
